{"screen_name": "198_298_398", "file": "198_298_398", "name": "ハローチキン", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1642157805078728708/6wgAeOx7.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1302583169980399616/1737522207/1500x500", "description": "はろー！", "total_works": 17, "scraped_works": 17, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 4000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 4000, "max": 4000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/198_298_398", "name": "198_298_398"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@198_298_398/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e8447090/uploads/origins/8406ddfb-bb31-4247-8c1c-5629c72e8717?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=843f733a1d264e011bac17fc7e0420c6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e8447090/uploads/origins/8406ddfb-bb31-4247-8c1c-5629c72e8717?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=843f733a1d264e011bac17fc7e0420c6, https://si.imgix.net/e8447090/uploads/origins/8406ddfb-bb31-4247-8c1c-5629c72e8717?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0b468dd35fce53ce7f48ba9cf37c061 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e8447090/uploads/origins/8406ddfb-bb31-4247-8c1c-5629c72e8717?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb9e9f53d5325f263a699f0a9ce44380 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "うちの創作子さん(お名前はリエル)にハローチキンさんが似合うと思ったお洋服を着せた絵をお願いします。\n少しチャイナ服寄りだと嬉しいです。\n表情、ポーズなど全ておまかせします。\n\n一応リエルさんの設定も簡単にお伝えしておきます。\n→母が天使、父が悪魔のハーフで性別は無し。相手の要望に合わせて性別を変えることができる。性に奔放で相手が男でも女でも夜を共にすることができる。\n悪魔っぽい少し目立つ犬歯がある。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HS1ScLxHRmrKmj1KY-pTinayCKXU341b", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@198_298_398/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8e65587f/uploads/origins/a6ec869c-854e-4fc0-8c4d-28e75fdccd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=146d5999f933a7f643d9f8f88fb07e85", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8e65587f/uploads/origins/a6ec869c-854e-4fc0-8c4d-28e75fdccd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=146d5999f933a7f643d9f8f88fb07e85, https://si.imgix.net/8e65587f/uploads/origins/a6ec869c-854e-4fc0-8c4d-28e75fdccd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f0f134346c8631487042c91a359fbb1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8e65587f/uploads/origins/a6ec869c-854e-4fc0-8c4d-28e75fdccd92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67b7da52e409eea18267b68c916cdad4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ハローチキン先生、初めまして\n個人Vtuberとして活動している紺野シノと申します。\nTwitterにてアークナイツのイラストを拝見して絵柄が良かったので、\n私自身のイラストをお願いしたくリクエストさせていただきした。\n\n■資料\nhttps://twitter.com/KONNO_SINO/status/1469243364520644611\nケモ耳時は人耳と銀色の耳飾りは無い設定です。\n構図や表情などについてはおまかせします。\n服装や髪型も好きにアレンジして頂いて大丈夫です。\n\n\n■使用範囲\n作成していただいたイラストはTwitterのアイコンや、配信サムネなど配信活動で使わせていただきたいと思っています。\n\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/KONNO_SINO/status/1469243364520644611", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@198_298_398/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dc5d0320/uploads/origins/7869ec70-3ffb-466d-b61f-d85f86bb1fce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb82a2cc08dddeb2262810af85c7af5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dc5d0320/uploads/origins/7869ec70-3ffb-466d-b61f-d85f86bb1fce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb82a2cc08dddeb2262810af85c7af5, https://si.imgix.net/dc5d0320/uploads/origins/7869ec70-3ffb-466d-b61f-d85f86bb1fce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5e6a0fe844ac3fedb7d5f5702979b53 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dc5d0320/uploads/origins/7869ec70-3ffb-466d-b61f-d85f86bb1fce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e94a779d582657db6b764e25d89e87ba 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "The art I got from you recently was so amazing!!!!\nThis time I was looking for art of me and my friend’s character, Lunari, in cosplay, like, taking a selfie together or maybe being back-to-back posing? Up to you!!\n\nNekoa: \nhttps://ibb.co/QQhG9Zs\nCosplay for Nekoa: \nhttps://ibb.co/mFkWdNJ\n\nLunari: \nhttps://ibb.co/yksfhbr\nCosplay for Lunari: \nhttps://ibb.co/8DqwnRx", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@198_298_398/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/28e95d73/uploads/origins/63d997c6-66e2-4821-8e90-30ca5493a3ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=064c9cd0d351ec62424fa1184f9582bb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/28e95d73/uploads/origins/63d997c6-66e2-4821-8e90-30ca5493a3ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=064c9cd0d351ec62424fa1184f9582bb, https://si.imgix.net/28e95d73/uploads/origins/63d997c6-66e2-4821-8e90-30ca5493a3ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2be9890bc4b160430e5b88ff85901609 2x, https://si.imgix.net/28e95d73/uploads/origins/63d997c6-66e2-4821-8e90-30ca5493a3ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4bf99e20b4372c763812eca7a427b4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello and thank you for your appeal!!\n\nI'd really love it if you could draw my character, Nekoa, in the outfit of SilverWolf from Honkai: StarRail!!! \nHere are some references:\nhttps://ibb.co/c3mC4rj\nhttps://ibb.co/C22bDtN", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@198_298_398/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0435b51f/uploads/origins/de2a246f-c5e5-456f-8254-6989522e53ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e168c9b61a980db6f51